SUMMARY:Oktoberfest (starts in Germany)
DESCRIPTION:Oktoberfest begins in September\, which is the first thing wort
 h knowing about it. The festival opens on the Theresienwiese in Munich on 
 the first Saturday after September 15 and runs to the first Sunday in Octo
 ber — a window the city moved earlier in 1872 to catch better weather. T
 he name stayed where the calendar used to be.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.c
